<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 569.69 MLN RAND S.AFRICAN BONDS FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 569.69 MLN RAND S.AFRICAN BONDS FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought 569.69 million rands worth of South African bonds on Friday after buying 428.39 million on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
